        "@value": "Supply Bill 2002"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2001/37/eng@/~cl_1",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "1",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2001/37/eng@",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "This Act may be cited as the Supply Act 2002. Issue and appropriation for the service of the year 2002"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2001/37/eng@/~cl_2",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "2",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2001/37/eng@",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "The issue of a sum not exceeding forty-nine billion nine hundred and eight million seven hundred and seventy-two thousand and five hundred and twenty ringgit (RM49,908,772,520) from the Consolidated Fund for the service of the year 2002 is hereby authorised, and that sum is appropriated for the purposes specified in the Schedule."
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2001/37/eng@/~sched_1",
      "@type": "akn:schedule",
      "eli:number": "1",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2001/37/eng@",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Purpose Title B. 1 Parliament B. 2 Office of the Keeper of the Rulers' Seal B. 3 Audit Department Purpose Title B. 4 Election Commission B. 5 Public Services Commission B. 6 Education Service Commission B. 7 Prime Minister's Department B. 8 Public Services Department B. 9 Statistics Department B. 10 Attorney General's Chambers B. 11 Anti-Corruption Agency B. 12 Office of the Federal Secretary Sabah B. 13 Office of the Federal Secretary Sarawak B. 14 Ministry of Housing and Local Government B. 15 Town and Country Planning Department B. 16 Fire and Rescue Department B. 17 Ministry of Youth and Sports B. 18 Ministry of Primary Industries B. 19 Ministry of Agriculture B. 20 Ministry of International Trade and Industry B. 21 Ministry of Domestic Trade and Consumer Affairs B. 22 Ministry of Culture. Arts and Tourism B. 23 Department of the National Archives B. 24 Museum and Antiquities Department B. 25 Ministry of Defence B. 26 Ministry of Education B. 27 Department of National Library B. 28 Treasury B. 29 Treasury General Services B. 30 Contribution to Statutory Funds B. 31 Royal Customs and Excise Department B. 32 Valuation and Property Services Department B. 33 Ministry of Works B. 34 Ministry of Health Supply Purpose Title B. 35 Ministry of Home Affairs B. 36 Ministry of Foreign Affairs B. 37 Ministry of Energy, Communications and Multimedia B. 38 Ministry of Transport B. 39 Ministry of Entrepreneur Development B. 40 Ministry of Rural Development B. 41 Ministry of Women and Family Development B. 42 Ministry of National Unity and Social Development B. 43 Ministry of Land and Co-operative Development B. 44 Ministry of Information B. 45 Ministry of Human Resources B. 46 Ministry of Science, Technology and the Environment TOTAL"
